{"3369260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ruinetarus", "steam_appid": 3369260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Background: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the disaster that occurred decades ago, the city was already in ruins. The vast majority of people had turned into monsters, these mindless creatures wandering among the ruins. Even so, a few people still relied on the city. They kept the civilization alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369260/extras/世界概念.png?t=1780628644\" /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A voxelized world? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open world with voxel art and unique artistic scenes will bring you a visual experience that is both familiar and strange!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369260/extras/车站前方.png?t=1780628644\" /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A unique battle relying on clocks and thick fog: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The concentration of the pendulum reflects Lula's state. The concentration of the map warns of the approaching monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always pay attention to the changes in all concentrations, which is often the key to survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In sync with the pendulum, master every aspect of the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the swing of the pendulum well and coordinate with the well-structured stance,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hit the monster and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369260/extras/战斗中露出肩膀也是在所难免.png?t=1780628644\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy the battle? But more importantly, please don't forget to live well. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing, cooking, working, shopping...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't underestimate the resilience of civilization so easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People within the ruins still lead a wonderful life. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The exquisite display of rail transit: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When traveling between cities by train, if you don't buy a ticket, you might be kicked off the train.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Background: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the disaster that occurred decades ago, the city was already in ruins. The vast majority of people had turned into monsters, these mindless creatures wandering among the ruins. Even so, a few people still relied on the city. They kept the civilization alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369260/extras/世界概念.png?t=1780628644\" /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A voxelized world? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open world with voxel art and unique artistic scenes will bring you a visual experience that is both familiar and strange!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369260/extras/车站前方.png?t=1780628644\" /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A unique battle relying on clocks and thick fog: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The concentration of the pendulum reflects Lula's state. The concentration of the map warns of the approaching monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always pay attention to the changes in all concentrations, which is often the key to survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In sync with the pendulum, master every aspect of the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the swing of the pendulum well and coordinate with the well-structured stance,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hit the monster and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369260/extras/战斗中露出肩膀也是在所难免.png?t=1780628644\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy the battle? But more importantly, please don't forget to live well. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing, cooking, working, shopping...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't underestimate the resilience of civilization so easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People within the ruins still lead a wonderful life. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The exquisite display of rail transit: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When traveling between cities by train, if you don't buy a ticket, you might be kicked off the train.</p>", "short_description": "The white-haired girl who fell from the high tower, your name is Liula. Live freely in this lonely and desolate city!", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369260/c7d7d5d0a036793753491ebf2824693be2f811d3/header.jpg?t=1780628644", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369260/b4b90ad95955efd7fea98d4c2091567a3e32ae1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780628644", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369260/b4b90ad95955efd7fea98d4c2091567a3e32ae1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780628644", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64位<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMDFX-4350/IntelCorei5-4460<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GTX 1050/AMD RX550<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</